{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人林愷鈴（Ashley）、應屆港姐三甲冠軍袁絲珩、亞軍鄧匡閔、季軍李澤欣及友誼小姐李澄晴等今日（25日）現身馬場出席珠寶品牌活動，談到珠寶收藏，Ashley坦言自己平時極少購買貴重珠寶，大多是欣賞居多，她透露媽媽龔慈恩偶爾會將自己喜歡的珠</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.774282+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T10:28:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_hash":"8b9849905c0addab0de1cf4ed16ed40e6c408fc9bb1875212b33d91598679f60","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}